OL,3,GNEWSAOpening of Severn Bridge
OL,4,Aremembered 60 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor many people living near the Severn
OL,7,FEstuary, jumping in the car and
OL,8,Fcrossing the border between England and
OL,9,FWales is just part of their everyday
OL,10,Fcommute.
OL,12,FBut 60 years ago, after
OL,13,Fthree-and-a-half years of construction
OL,14,Fat a cost of some #8m, this
OL,15,Fordinary-seeming journey over the
OL,16,FSevern Bridge was something to
OL,17,Fcelebrate.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
