OL,3,GNEWSAOpening of Severn Bridge
OL,4,Aremembered 60 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnthusiastic motorists spent days
OL,7,Fqueueing to use it, and on the day
OL,8,Fitself - 8 September 1966 - hundreds
OL,9,Fgathered to watch the Queen Elizabeth
OL,10,FII officially open the bridge to the
OL,11,Fpublic.
OL,13,FChris Witts, a River Severn historian
OL,14,Fwitnessed several fatalities on the
OL,15,Fwater prior to the bridge's opening,
OL,16,Fand said many people now "take it for
OL,17,Fgranted" six decades on.
